attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on the anchor.** Column 0, `betA`, is carried by 100% of chromosomes, a persistent family, in a region of plasticity in 100% of calls {S1}. The model names 99% of them, at 0.21 bits {S1}.

@variable **A fork follows at column 1**, `ykgH`, carried by 82%, with `ipbA` in 16% {S2.c1}. The `ecp` genes, columns 15 to 20, are [[fimbrial chaperone]] {S4.c15-20, Q}. Through columns 47 to 54 a branch of 8 families runs in 11 to 13%, [[phage head and capsid]] {S4.b47, Q}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 95% against 79%, and hesitates less there, 0.41 against 1.08 bits {M}. Its most hesitant column, 29, `pinE`, is a variable column, at 1.86 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends on a branch of 6 persistent families**, columns 74 to 79, `yafC` to `metQ`, carried by 18 to 23% {S4.b74}. The last column is `yafD`, in 25% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 80% of genes**, 1.06 bits on average, perplexity 2.9 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 1.26 against 0.44 bits, and names fewer genes, 75% against 92% {C}.

